{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":25.420000076293945,"text":"A small painting with intense, almost electric light, where the bodies are stretched tall and the colors are not natural. This is El Greco's signature, and the reason you can recognize him instantly. He was not trying to paint what the eye sees. He painted what he wanted you to feel. 300 years later, painters of the 20th century rediscovered him and claimed him as one of their own.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.5},{"word":"small","start":0.5,"end":0.8999999761581421},{"word":"painting","start":0.8999999761581421,"end":1.3200000524520874},{"word":"with","start":1.3200000524520874,"end":1.7799999713897705},{"word":"intense","start":1.7799999713897705,"end":2.359999895095825},{"word":"almost","start":2.6600000858306885,"end":2.9200000762939453},{"word":"electric","start":2.9200000762939453,"end":3.5199999809265137},{"word":"light","start":3.5199999809265137,"end":3.880000114440918},{"word":"where","start":4.21999979019165,"end":4.400000095367432},{"word":"the","start":4.400000095367432,"end":4.900000095367432},{"word":"bodies","start":4.900000095367432,"end":4.900000095367432},{"word":"are","start":4.900000095367432,"end":5.599999904632568},{"word":"stretched","start":5.599999904632568,"end":5.599999904632568},{"word":"tall","start":5.599999904632568,"end":6.099999904632568},{"word":"and","start":6.099999904632568,"end":6.519999980926514},{"word":"the","start":6.519999980926514,"end":7.059999942779541},{"word":"colors","start":7.059999942779541,"end":7.059999942779541},{"word":"are","start":7.059999942779541,"end":7.320000171661377},{"word":"not","start":7.320000171661377,"end":7.619999885559082},{"word":"natural","start":7.619999885559082,"end":7.980000019073486},{"word":"This","start":8.539999961853027,"end":8.9399995803833},{"word":"is","start":8.9399995803833,"end":9.300000190734863},{"word":"El","start":9.300000190734863,"end":9.5600004196167},{"word":"Greco's","start":9.5600